flowchart LR
    classDef agent fill:#e6f3ff,stroke:#1f6feb,color:#0b3a66;
    classDef cli fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#5b3a00;
    classDef mcp fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#1b3d1f;
    classDef wiki fill:#f3e8ff,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#3a1d6b;

    Agent[Agent running this skill]:::agent
    StatusCli[livewiki status --json]:::cli
    UpdateCli[livewiki update --json]:::cli
    Package[Work package: debt, snippets, validAnchors]:::cli
    WriteDoc[livewiki_write_doc MCP tool]:::mcp
    DirectEdit[Direct edit of wiki page file]:::wiki
    Verify[livewiki verify]:::cli
    Record[livewiki update --record-write]:::cli
    WikiPage[livewiki/<wiki_path>.md]:::wiki

    Agent --> StatusCli
    StatusCli --> Package
    Package --> UpdateCli
    UpdateCli --> Agent
    Agent --> WriteDoc
    WriteDoc --> Verify
    Agent --> DirectEdit
    DirectEdit --> Verify
    Verify --> WikiPage
    Agent --> Record
